[IMPLEMENTATION PROTOCOL: Archiving/Pruning Old Logs]
To safely identify and process files (e.g., log files) that are older than a specified threshold (e.g., 30 days) for eventual deletion or compression, use the `-mtime` parameter.

***Safety Protocol Advisory:*** *Never use `find ... -delete` or `find ... -exec rm {} \;` without first testing the search parameters using `ls -l`.*

